## Best Settings for Square Radiant Cut Diamond

The square radiant needs a setting with a square head — four prongs that sit at the clipped corners, not a round basket that fights the stone's geometry. Here are the three best options across price points.

### Setting 1 — Knife Edge Solitaire White Gold: $925

The [Knife Edge Solitaire by James Allen in 14k White Gold](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/knife-edge-solitaire-by-james-allen-item-316048?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is the most efficient setting for a square radiant. It holds the stone with four prongs at the corners, keeps a low profile on the band, and puts the entire focus on the diamond. Nothing competes with the stone.

At [$925](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/knife-edge-solitaire-by-james-allen-item-316048?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — 982 reviews — this is the best entry-level setting for a square radiant. Combined with a [1ct G-VS2 natural at $2,318](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/25995245?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational), total ring: [$3,243](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/knife-edge-solitaire-by-james-allen-item-316048?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational).

### Setting 2 — Riviera Pavé White Gold: $1,500

The [Riviera Pavé Diamond Engagement Ring in 18k White Gold](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/riviera-pave-item-195326?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) adds a row of pavé diamonds along the band. The straight lines of the pavé band echo the straight sides of the square radiant — the stone reads more intentionally geometric when the band reinforces the shape.

At [$1,500](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/riviera-pave-item-195326?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — 479 reviews. Combined with a [1ct G-VS2 natural at $2,318](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/25995245?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational), total ring: [$3,818](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/riviera-pave-item-195326?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational).

### Setting 3 — Classic Four Prong Platinum Solitaire: $1,180

The [Classic Four Prong Solitaire in Platinum](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/classic-four-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-platinum-item-194156?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is the premium version of the solitaire approach. Platinum is harder than gold and offers lifetime durability without replating. The four-prong square head protects the clipped corners while keeping the stone fully visible.

At [$1,180](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/classic-four-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-platinum-item-194156?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — 1,815 reviews. Combined with a [1ct G-VS2 natural at $2,318](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/25995245?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational), total ring: [$3,498](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/classic-four-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-platinum-item-194156?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational).

**Settings to avoid:** Round basket settings designed for round brilliant cuts. They conflict with the square radiant's geometry. The stone's straight edges and clipped corners need a square head — confirm the setting head shape before ordering.

